    {
      "id": "claim_1df82c6fd7904f80914230b79507a1d4",
      "statement": "Listing liveness and expiry: a row is live iff status is listed, not a history row, and expires_epoch >= now; store.prune_expired transitions listed rows past their TTL to status expired with is_history=1, appending an audited agent.expired event per row, and runs both at DirectoryService construction (startup prune) and lazily inside live_agents/count_live before reads — behavior pinned by tests that advance the injected clock and restart on the same DB.",
