    {
      "id": "claim_92288d29cb0b4220a97d5557feb6c43a",
      "statement": "Search runs in memory over store.live_agents (listed rows ordered by registered_epoch): each manifest is matched by _matches_query, then build_trust_block assembles the trust block which _passes_trust_filters checks; total counts all matches after both filter stages regardless of pagination and the response window is matches[offset : offset + limit]. The v1 shape is results as manifest plus trust with total, limit, offset and directory_fingerprint; the same call exposes a manifests projection that the legacy /search alias serializes as a bare manifest list.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/http_api.py#L304-L339",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c2f034ecca001d105d188be46f98d2e088e80a4c8f5a11a6d55f678d7a3ebfd:"
