        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9da648ced147485daf63e31c01b61c87",
      "statement": "build_trust_block assembles the §5.2 trust block as labelled signals with provenance and never a verdict: listed_since/age_days and last_heartbeat/fresh computed against the injected clock, endpoint_proof_at, the endpoint-host-primary domain verification chosen by DomainService.primary_verification, active inbound vouches with voucher tenure, vouch annotations, raw report counters, status with parsed suspension record, block_recommendation, always-empty reputation_history and audit_verifiable true. Absent mechanisms use explicit no-signal defaults (vouches_in [], mutual_vouch_density 0.0, empty reports, block_recommendation None) and vouchers_share_registration_cluster is hard-coded False because registration-IP clustering is not tracked — never fabricated or collapsed into a trust score.",
