      "statement": "get_agent returns manifest and trust for a live listing only: an unknown fingerprint raises AGENT_NOT_FOUND while an existing entry that is expired or suspended uniformly raises AGENT_NOT_LISTED, so the anonymous API never distinguishes suspended from expired entries.",
