    {
      "id": "claim_2bb294bc357440d9b6bf6b97fbb0f541",
      "statement": "L3 VouchService enforces vouch mechanics only: create requires a live voucher and vouchee, lowercase scope, weight 1 in v1, RFC 3339 created_at/expires_at with future expiry within config.vouch_max_expiry_days (180), and a signature by the voucher over the body minus the signature field; the store additionally caps active outgoing edges at config.vouch_max_outgoing (VOUCH_LIMIT_REACHED) and rejects duplicate active (voucher, vouchee, scope) edges (VOUCH_EXISTS). Revoke requires a signature over {voucher_fingerprint, revoked_at} by the original voucher. Reads serve raw edges: inbound_signal with per-vouch voucher_tenure_hours, annotations with mutual-vouch density, and trust_paths a BFS over active edges only with max_depth clamped to at most 2.",
