      "id": "claim_7f5441d2303a450eb2575af7e3b833cb",
      "statement": "ModerationService authorizes operator-held moderator keys configured as config.moderator_keys (unknown key MODERATOR_UNKNOWN, bad signature TAKEDOWN_UNAUTHORIZED); takedown (requires an existing report) and direct suspend both write through store.suspend_agent with actor moderator:<fp> and audited events moderator.takedown or moderator.suspend; unsuspend restores a suspended entry to listed with a fresh TTL and clears its suspension record; appeal is signed by the agent rather than a moderator and creates an open appeal row with audit appeal.submitted.",
