      "id": "claim_91dbb723df9c42f1a22c7a38ea927cd2",
      "statement": "AuditService wraps the store hash chain: sign_body returns a base64 Ed25519 signature over the canonical JSON of a response body (basis of X-HAAP-Directory-Signature on audit endpoints); head and checkpoints expose directory-key-signed {seq, entry_hash, ts} payloads with create_checkpoint persisting them and maybe_checkpoint honoring the checkpoint_interval_s cadence; verify(seq) recomputes chain validity up to a sequence number; agent_audit returns a redacted per-agent view containing detail_hash only, never detail bodies.",
